# Privacy Policy for Meatlearner AI Posts

Effective date: May 11, 2026

Meatlearner AI Posts is a personal tool used by Hillary Sanders to create and publish posts to LinkedIn through the LinkedIn API.

## Information the app accesses

When authorized through LinkedIn, the app may access basic LinkedIn account information and posting permissions approved by the user during the LinkedIn OAuth authorization process.

## How the information is used

The app uses authorized LinkedIn access only to create, manage, or publish LinkedIn posts as requested by the account owner.

## Data storage

The app does not sell, rent, or share personal information with third parties.

The app may store authentication tokens or other technical information only as needed to connect to LinkedIn and perform authorized posting actions.

## Third-party services

The app uses LinkedIn’s API and OAuth services. Use of LinkedIn is also subject to LinkedIn’s own terms and privacy policies.

## Changes to this policy

This policy may be updated from time to time. Any updates will be posted on this page.
